      "coverage": "The frozen patch a8dcd4c..d87a3be (installed 1.2.20 to this release) was reviewed at 42b7624 by both reviewers and then delta by delta (42b7624..4ae2f55, 4ae2f55..0ee2337, 0ee2337..d87a3be); every P0-P2 finding was fixed and re-confirmed by the reviewer that raised it. Open P3 follow-ups: the WSL result-cache key records the literal 'auto' instead of the resolved -MaxThreads; explicit -TimeoutSeconds below 311 is refused; test runtime logs from local-data are copied into the bundle tests/ folder; the Trivy discard ignores a failing find (the 6-hour DB freshness gate still applies); about 1-in-70 derived subnet collisions fail closed at network create; ProviderResponseCache counts a slow but successful save as a storage failure (test now uses a 1 s budget); intermittent first-run HarnessProcess failure on the Mac; calendar autoload re-pump; per-step deadline in Invoke-LocalGates.",
